## 3. C# 9+ 现代特性（Unity 6 支持）

### 3.1 Record 类型用于数据

✅ **正确**：
```csharp
public record PlayerData(string Name, int Level, float Health);

// 不可变数据，自动实现 Equals/ToString
var data = new PlayerData("Hero", 1, 100f);
var upgraded = data with { Level = 2 };  // 非破坏性修改
```

### 3.2 Init-only 属性

✅ **正确**：
```csharp
public class WeaponConfig {
    public string Name { get; init; }
    public float Damage { get; init; }
    public float Range { get; init; }
}

var sword = new WeaponConfig { Name = "Longsword", Damage = 25f, Range = 2f };
```

### 3.3 Pattern Matching

✅ **正确**：
```csharp
var result = enemy switch {
    Boss boss => boss.Enrage(),
    Minion minion => minion.Flee(),
    _ => null
};
```

